        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-07-18T23:22:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t like this sequence:\n\n\tCPRINTF(\"[\");\n\tCPRINT_TIMESTAMP();\n\tCPRINTF(\" ...\", ...);\n\nbecause it can be:\n\n\tCPRINTF(\"[%.6lu ...\", get_time().val, ...);\n\nMaybe we can do:\n\n\t#define _TIMESTAMP_ PRECISION, get_time().val/10^(6-PRECISION), \n\nThen,\n\n\tCPRINTF(\"[%.*lu ...\", _TIMESTAMP_, ...);\n\nOr you may have a better idea?",
      "parentUuid": "969eec3c_b5b6a42d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 118,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 118,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "0ab02441dc7eb1263fed95935d63bce7ad92e35a",
